<a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/3ba7786a79d9408a91ca37e2bbc89ffa?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="ODI &amp; Columbus Crew Networking Event Registration Page" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/09/8225858/4975104/copy-of-copy-of-copy-of-odicrew-event-flyer-2_crop.png" style="width: 590px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="NEW ODI Crew Event Flyer" width="590" height="835"></a><p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;" align="left"><br>The City of Columbus Office of Diversity and Inclusion, in collaboration with the Columbus Crew, invites business owners to join us as we showcase upcoming bid opportunities from:<br><br></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">Department of Recreation and Parks </li>
