<li style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">Department of Finance and Management</li>
<li style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">Department of Public Health</li>
<li style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">Department of Development</li>
<li style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Department of Public Service</li>
</ul>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;">This event will be an opportunity for businesses to engage with local agencies and learn the benefits of becoming certified with The City of Columbus.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;"> </p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;" align="left">Come network 1-on-1 with professionals and take your business to the next level!</p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;" align="left"> </p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;" align="center">Thursday, October 5th | 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM</p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;" align="center"><a href="https://goo.gl/maps/JKDs8KYntApPU9Kp7?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Location of Lower.com Field" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">Huntington Club at Lower.com Field</a><br><a href="https://goo.gl/maps/JKDs8KYntApPU9Kp7?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Location of Lower.com Field" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">96 Columbus Crew Way, Columbus, OH 43215</a></p>
